    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620878
    m_Localized: STORAGE SLOT / Rifle, compact rifle and shotgun. Replaces capacitor
      or rapid charge bridge. Energy reduction is rounded up before the hit-marker
      surcharge; existing biological research still applies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620879
    m_Localized: "SOURCE: MC00 random Mooncore event \u2192 carry the fragment through
      a successful extraction \u2192 move it to storage. Circuit boards and copper
      coils come from supply caches. Only recovered, non-emergency materials count."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620880
    m_Localized: Recover the required alien organs and tissue, then move them to
      personal storage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620881
    m_Localized: Permanent knowledge is retained after death and applies on your
      next deployment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620882
    m_Localized: Research does not grant free ammunition or a physical module.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620883
    m_Localized: READY / {0} OWNED / {1} REQUIRED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
