    m_Localized: BASE TRANSACTION UNAVAILABLE / FINISH RAID OR RECONNECT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620893
    m_Localized: Consumes the materials shown above and creates 1 module in storage.
      No charge if storage cannot accept it. Install it in Halo modification before
      deployment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620894
    m_Localized: Consumes 1 recovered fragment and 2 circuit boards. Permanently
      unlocks fabrication; no module is granted. Fabricating your first module is
      a separate cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620895
    m_Localized: Consumes the materials shown above once and permanently saves this
      research.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620896
    m_Localized: CONSUME MATERIALS / FABRICATE 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620897
    m_Localized: RESEARCH AND PERMANENTLY UNLOCK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620898
    m_Localized: OWNED {0} / INSTALLED {1}. Knowledge survives death; physical modules
      can be lost with your equipment. Owning a module does not equip it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620899
    m_Localized: Permanent knowledge survives death. No physical item is granted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620901
    m_Localized: "{0}: ENERGY {1} \u2192 {2} / CHARGE {3:0.00}s \u2192 {4:0.00}s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620902
    m_Localized: Module fabricated in storage. Go to Halo modification to install
      it before deployment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620903
    m_Localized: Mooncore knowledge saved permanently. Go to fabrication next; no
      module has been granted or equipped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620904
    m_Localized: Store the required materials before researching. Mooncore fragments
      must have been successfully extracted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620905
    m_Localized: Research Mooncore stabilization before fabricating this module.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620906
    m_Localized: Not enough fabrication materials in storage. Recover a Mooncore
      fragment and store a copper coil.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620907
    m_Localized: Removing requires a free storage cell. The module remains a physical
      item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620908
    m_Localized: STORAGE FULL / FREE SPACE BEFORE REMOVING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620909
    m_Localized: 'CURRENT: {0}E / {1:0.00}s / {2} ROUNDS / {3:0.##} DAMAGE

      AFTER:
      {4}E / {5:0.00}s / {6} ROUNDS / {7:0.##} DAMAGE'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620910
    m_Localized: 'Cannot install: replacement space or carried weight is insufficient.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620911
    m_Localized: SLOT CONFLICT / replaces the installed module; the old module returns
      to the incoming module's location.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620912
    m_Localized: AVAILABLE SLOT / install this physical module before deployment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620913
    m_Localized: OWNED / NOT INSTALLED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620914
    m_Localized: "Mooncore recycler: research and fabricate at Suppliers \u2192 Halo
      research. Other compatible modules can be bought or recovered from caches."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620915
    m_Localized: "An anomalous MC00 crystal. Successfully extract it, then store
      it for Mooncore stabilization research and repeatable recycler fabrication
      at Suppliers \u2192 Halo research. Research and fabrication consume separate
      fragments only when confirmed. Can still be sold; carried fragments drop on
      death."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620917
    m_Localized: "; first non-emergency recovery also grants +10. Keep the fragment
      for Suppliers \u2192 Halo research: permanent stabilization research, then
      repeatable recycler fabrication. Confirmed actions consume separate materials.
      Selling remains available."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620918
    m_Localized: ; first non-emergency recovery also grants +10. Archive drives remain
      trade goods; no archive research recipe is available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620919
    m_Localized: "Recovered materials are retained. Mooncore fragments can fund stabilization
      research and repeatable recycler fabrication at Suppliers \u2192 Halo research;
      install the crafted module before deploying. Archive drives remain trade goods."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620920
    m_Localized: Recovered Mooncore fragments fund stabilization research and repeatable
      recycler fabrication. Install the module in Halo modification. Knowledge survives
      death; equipment can be lost. Reading records consumes nothing. Fragments and
      archive drives can still be sold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4445446490304512
    m_Localized: Energy per round reduced by one third (rounded up); charge time
      +20%. Capacity and base damage unchanged. Cold-silver return arcs pulse during
      charging and firing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4445446532247552
    m_Localized: "BEFORE \u2192 AFTER / ENERGY PER ROUND 100% \u2192 2/3 (rounded
      up) / CHARGE TIME 100% \u2192 120%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4445446532247553
    m_Localized: 'Fabricated after Mooncore stabilization research. Install in a
      rifle or shotgun storage slot: energy per round reduced by one third (rounded
      up), charge time +20%. Knowledge is permanent; this physical module can be
      lost on death.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
