  - m_Id: 8715687344128331
    m_Localized: "COLLAR O\u2082 / {0:0}%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8753998678345497
    m_Localized: Equip in the shield slot. Absorbs combat damage before health; excess
      damage passes through. After 6 seconds without a hit, restores 8 shield per
      second and spends 0.5 energy per shield. Recharge using charged cells in pockets
      or an equipped rig. Does not block suffocation, hunger or thirst.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8417738011263120
    m_Localized: A neck-fitted life-support collar with a lilac bow and a gold cat
      bell. Follows the neck bones and uses the existing oxygen reserve, canisters
      and pressurized air. Does not provide ballistic protection or combat shielding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8515315481831250
    m_Localized: 'Equip in the melee slot and bind to a number key. Left click: light
      attack. Right click: heavy attack. Attacks use stamina; walls block hits. With
      no active weapon, fists are the fallback.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8615997764921137
    m_Localized: Stored battery energy powers weapon reloading and shield recharging.
      Move cells to pockets or an equipped rig before use. Recharging the shield
      consumes only the energy transferred.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
