  - m_Id: 5591439740213562
    m_Localized: A plain neck-fitted life-support collar. Projects a spherical helmet
      without cat ears and uses the existing oxygen reserve, canisters and pressurized
      air.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51176637495477051
    m_Localized: A compact back-mounted subspace anchor with one capacity ring and
      a 3x4 storage grid. Carried weight still applies. Move supplies to pockets
      or a rig before use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28642487360890836
    m_Localized: A back-mounted subspace anchor with two capacity rings and a 5x6
      storage grid. Carried weight still applies. Move supplies to pockets or a rig
      before use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24539859515133516
    m_Localized: A large back-mounted subspace anchor with three capacity rings and
      a 6x7 storage grid. Carried weight still applies. Move supplies to pockets
      or a rig before use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57721484356445718
    m_Localized: A visible waist-mounted shield projector with charge indicators.
      Equip in the shield slot. Absorbs combat damage before health; excess damage
      passes through. After 6 seconds without a hit, restores 8 shield per second
      and spends 0.5 energy per shield. Recharge using charged cells in pockets or
      an equipped rig. Does not block suffocation, hunger or thirst.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33747919478639220
    m_Localized: A back-mounted scout subspace anchor with one ring, paired stabilizer
      fins and a 4x4 storage grid. Carried weight still applies. Move supplies to
      pockets or a rig before use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
